How to Make Agua de Florida (Traditional Inspiration)
-----------------------------------------------------

Some people are curious about how to make [Agua de Florida](/gb/store/agua-de-florida) at home. While commercial formulas vary, traditional recipes typically include:

*   Citrus peels
